  "details": "When you do a lot of gestures it often happens that you accidentally grab something like a world object, your personal mirror, your camera or your friends PhysBones and it can get really annoying.\nHaving a toggle to simply deactivate grabbing of anything while still being able to do gestures would be really good. You could put that toggle in the tools section of the radial menu. \nAlso adding it as an option for a key binding for like thumbstick press, would give the option to toggle it really fast and on the fly.",
